CodeAuditBot 🛡️
An independent Telegram bot for automated Static Application Security Testing (SAST) and vulnerability detection using a local language model via Ollama (⁠qwen2.5:7b⁠).
🚀 Features
 Accepts code files (⁠.js⁠, ⁠.py⁠, ⁠.php⁠, ⁠.txt⁠, etc.) directly in Telegram.
 Automatic file size limits (context protection).
 Deep security analysis (injection detection, secret leaks, logic errors).
 Secure code alternative generation.
 Persistent logging of all requests and errors using ⁠winston⁠ to ⁠logs/audit.log⁠.
🛠 Installation and Setup
1. Clone the repository or copy the project files.
2. Install dependencies:
npm install
3. Create a ⁠.env⁠ file based on your configuration and specify your Telegram bot token:
BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token
OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434/api/generate
4. Make sure your local Ollama server is running with the ⁠qwen2.5:7b⁠ model:
ollama run qwen2.5:7b
5. Run the bot:
node index.js